  "explanation": {
    "md_es": [
      "**Superlativo:** **the** + adjetivo + **-est** / **the most** + adjetivo largo.",
      "",
      "| Adjetivo | Superlativo |",
      "|---|---|",
      "| tall | the tall**est** |",
      "| big | the big**gest** |",
      "| nice | the nic**est** |",
      "| easy | the eas**iest** |",
      "| expensive | the **most** expensive |",
      "| interesting | the **most** interesting |",
      "| good | the **best** |",
      "| bad | the **worst** |",
      "",
      "**Siempre con the:** *She is the tallest girl.* (no *She is tallest.*)",
      "",
      "**Para delimitar el grupo:** **in** + lugar o grupo (*in the world, in the class, in town*) y **of** + conjunto (*of all, of the three*).",
      "*It's the biggest city **in** the country.* · *He's the youngest **of** the three brothers.*",
      "",
      "**One of the + superlativo + plural:** *The Nile is one of the longest rivers.*",
      "",
      "Pronunciación: *-est* /ɪst/: *biggest* /ˈbɪɡɪst/."
    ],
    "common_mistakes_es": [
      {
        "wrong": "She is tallest.",
        "right": "She is the tallest.",
        "note": "Falta the."
      },
      {
        "wrong": "the most cheap",
        "right": "the cheapest",
        "note": "Adjetivos cortos: -est."
      }
    ],
    "false_friends": []
  },
